{"id":687,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It’s said that Malamar’s hypnotic powers played a role in certain history-changing events."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Gazing at its luminescent spots will quickly induce a hypnotic state, putting the observer under Malamar’s control."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It flashes the pattern on its torso to control its prey and draw them in. The edges of its fins are supremely sharp."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"When it comes to strong hypnosis, there’s an endless number of people who utilize Malamar for their nefarious deeds."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y"],"text":"It lures its prey close with hypnotic motions, then wraps its tentacles around it before finishing it off with digestive fluids."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X"],"text":"It wields the most compelling hypnotic powers of any Pokémon, and it forces others to do whatever it wants."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Contrary","hidden":false,"description":"Reverses any stat changes affecting the Pokémon so that attempts to boost its stats instead lower them—and attempts to lower its stats will boost them."},{"name":"Suction Cups","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon uses suction cups to stay in one spot. This protects it from moves and items that would force it to switch out."},{"name":"Infiltrator","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's moves are unaffected by the target's barriers, substitutes, and the like."}],"eggGroups":["Water 1","Water 2"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Blue","shape":"Blob","evolution":{"id":686,"name":"Inkay","condition":null,"children":[{"id":687,"name":"Malamar","condition":"Lv. 30, with the console upside down","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,35],[1,64],[1,95],[1,179],[9,371],[12,365],[15,60],[18,207],[21,163],[24,400],[27,427],[33,415],[37,492],[42,576],[47,276]],"machine":[332,226,347,399,203,797,263,313,53,374,492,248,416,356,